 "remarks": "South Wilton's newly remodeled 4-bedroom luxury house with modern elegance. Designer's custom kitchen with walk-in pantry and plenty of cabinets. Formal Dining room and adjacent Living room with fireplace showcase walls of windows for natural light. A large Family room is ready for your entertaining and gatherings. Upstairs includes a timeless 4-bedroom layout. The center hallway leads to a luxury Primary Bedroom Suite, 3 additional bedrooms, and laundry with a built-in utility sink. The Primary Suite is bright and airy, with high cathedral ceilings, plenty of large windows, a large walk-in closet, and a modern ensuite bathroom. 2 additional bedrooms share the hallway full bathroom with a tub. The 4th bedroom has an ensuite full bathroom with a shower. All bedrooms are good size. Hardwood throughout the house. Large deck and charming covered front porch. Standby Generac generator for the house. All new appliances, including washer & dryer. Professionally landscaped and manicured grounds with flat, private lawns. Available for immediate occupancy. *** INTERIOR PHOTOS COMING ON 10/2 ***",
